    <h1>JustInvoice vs Wave vs FreshBooks — the real 2026 cost comparison for freelancers</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted);">Wave is "free" but charges 2.9% + 60¢ per transaction. FreshBooks starts at $17/mo and caps features by tier. JustInvoice is $9/mo USD flat with zero transaction fees. Works in 40+ countries. Here are the actual numbers, with no marketing spin.</p>

