    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink); margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.25rem; background: #fffbf0; border-left: 4px solid #f5b800; border-radius: 8px;"><strong>The hidden problem with most invoicing apps (Wave, FreshBooks, InvoiceFast, Square Invoices, PayPal invoicing):</strong> your client gets an invoice, opens it, then has to manually pay by e-Transfer, bank transfer, or visit a different site. That friction costs you <strong>11+ days on average</strong> before the invoice is paid. JustInvoice is one of the only modern invoicing tools that puts a <strong>"Pay Now" button right on the invoice</strong> — client clicks, pays with card, done. No friction. No "I'll do it later."</p>

