    <h2>The actual math — what do you pay per year?</h2>

    <p>The marketing copy for Wave says "free invoicing." The reality is more nuanced. Wave is free for the software, but every invoice paid through Wave Payments costs you 2.9% + 60¢.</p>

    <h3>If you bill $3,000 / month (small freelancer or solo agency)</h3>
    <table class="cost-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Tool</th><th>Monthly</th><th>Annual</th><th>Effective per invoice</th></tr>
      </thead>
